{"kind":"dismissal","critique_id":"20260902T212051681Z-b3fa0243:4","reason":"unassignable: The specification states 'The module name is verb-first kebab-case and says what the service does' with examples 'create-review.ts', 'rank-parsons.ts'. 'send-newsletter.ts' appears to follow this pattern (verb-first: 'send', kebab-case). The critique that it's 'verb-last / noun-first' seems to be a subjective interpretation disagreement rather than a clear violation of the spec's text. The spec doesn't provide enough detail to distinguish between acceptable verb-first patterns.","timestamp":"2026-09-02T22:30:25.880Z"}
